<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News shares drop on flat Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News shares drop on flat Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>SSYDNEY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in global media group The News Corp Ltd slumped 13 cents to A$7.00 in early Tuesday morning trade after it announced a lower than expected flat net profit before abnormals of A$285 million for the first quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected net profit before abnormals to rise about 15 percent to A$320 million to A$330 million for the quarter.</p>
</text>
